ion Exceeded 6 GB','Hello Team,\n\nWe have received a Coralogix alert regarding high memory utilization in the Magic / Christie Digital Kubernetes environment, where pod memory usage exceeded 6 GB.\n\nUpon review, we observed that the mosquitto-5454b9975-dkljx pod in the Christie Digital environment is consuming a high amount of memory.','critical','closed',22,'Aatif Shaikh',22,'Christie Digital',12,'mosquitto',NULL,'Infrastructure',1,'Integration',NULL,NULL,'[]',1,NULL,'2026-08-23 23:26','2026-08-23 23:26:00','2026-08-24 03:26:00.000000','2026-08-27 04:00','2026-08-27 04:00:00','2026-08-27 08:00:00.000000','2026-08-27','EST','America/New_York',0,0,0,NULL,'The pod memory incresed above 6 GB due to excesive mqtt, mosquitto logs and page cache.','We have deleted the logs and cleared the page cache memory','By OC Team','00135784',NULL,'2m',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'76h 34m',4594,'2026-08-24 04:29:46','2026-09-28 13:44:20'),(703,'INC-228','00135798','Christie Digital_EC2 Low Free Disk Space','We have received an alert for free disk space low on Christie Digital Production EC2 environment. There is low disk space for the C: Drive on Christie Digital Production EC2 environment.','critical','closed',3,'Rohan Shelar',3,'Christie Digital',12,'EC2',NULL,'Infrastructure',1,'Integration',NULL,NULL,'[]',1,NULL,'2026-08-25 04:02','2026-08-25 04:02:00','2026-08-25 08:02:00.000000','2026-08-25 05:02','2026-08-25 05:02:00','2026-08-25 09:02:00.000000','2026-08-25','EST','America/New_York',0,0,0,NULL,'When investigated we observed that xpi logs were consuming 29 GB of disk space from following directory - C:\\xpi\\xpi4141\\Runtime\\Logs\\java','We created the windows batch script which will clear logs files older than 30 days. Also, we have created a windows task for scheduled cleanup. The current free space is 21GB. The issue has been resolved.','By OC Team','00135798',NULL,'5m',5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'40m',40,'2026-08-25 11:32:12','2026-09-28 13:44:20'),(712,'INC-30